  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supprot IFRC WASH Global Strategy Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All national societies</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLRC is one of the two European National Societies involved in the support of the IFRC WASH global strategy revision by the Health and Care department in Geneva. This is a participatory process with all 5 regions involved that NLRC supports as a facilitator and a convener to bring together the context analysis as well as collecting and inputting in the need analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IFRC Global WASH strategy will be the roadmap for the global direction of IFRC and the whole IFRC network on WASH up to 2030. With the contribution of NLRC in COP28, Water at the Heart and UN Water Summit we are considered one of the major players and having the opportunity of influencing the global direction, specifically with our pioneering of the Water and Climate integrated approach.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We offer in-kind time of one of our consultant.</narrative>
  </description>
